  "Id": 178,
  "Title": " Persian Fire and Steel a big hit for ISMC",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "Dr Manouchehr Khorasani speaks at ISMC",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<p>Arms and armoury enthusiasts formed an appreciative audience for ISMC's guest speaker Dr Manouchehr Khorasani on Friday 6 November.  The lecture was chaired by ISMC Associate Professor, Dr Stephane Pradines and saw Dr Khorasani share insights from his new book; Persian Fire and Steel, Historical Firearms of Iran.  A world-renowned expert on Iranian arms and armoury, Dr Khorasani has written five books and co-authored four books, as well as publishing 147 articles in different journals across the world, winning the Book Prize of the Islamic Republic of Iran in 2009 and 2012. </p><p>the Islamic Republic of Iran in 2009 and 2012. </p>",
